{
  "comment": "The services the owner's content arrives from, each a declaration: its web origin, the kinds of content it holds and their schema.org types, and how each of the three browser routes reaches it. PrismSource (app/src/PrismSource.lex.tex) decides every read by service and route; the page writes the extension from this file (site/device/extension.mjs), so the extension's permissions are exactly the declared origins. Routes: seen = what the service's web app shows the owner in their signed-in tab; own = pages the service itself serves the owner, read by GET with the owner's own sign-in; export = the service's own data download, read when it lands in a granted folder or is dropped. Connecting: each service names the steps the person takes (connect: key, word, kind, probe, how), from which the Connections setting is drawn; a service's state is off, step (its next undone step), live, paused or refused. kinds: extension, open-tab, pin-tab, sign-in, grant-folder, approve-out. out: approve (sent only after the person approves it in the Prism) or refused (not sent).",
  "services": [
    {
      "key": "gmail",
      "name": "Gmail",
      "directions": [
        "in",
        "out"
      ],
      "origins": [
        "https://mail.google.com/"
      ],
      "kinds": {
        "message": "EmailMessage"
      },
      "seen": {
        "ids": [
          "data-legacy-message-id",
          "data-legacy-thread-id"
        ],
        "permIds": [
          "data-thread-perm-id",
          "data-message-id"
        ],
        "key": "var GLOBALS=\\[(?:[^,\\]]*,){9}\"([0-9a-f]{8,12})\""
      },
      "own": [
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "list": {
            "url": "https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/feed/atom",
            "id": "message_id=([0-9a-f]{12,20})"
          },
          "item": {
            "urls": [
              "https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?ik={key}&view=om&permmsgid=msg-f:{decimal}",
              "https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?view=om&th={id}"
            ],
            "unwrap": "raw_message_text"
          },
          "format": "eml"
        }
      ],
      "export": [
        "mbox",
        "eml"
      ],
      "connect": [
        {
          "key": "extension",
          "word": "Add the extension",
          "kind": "extension",
          "probe": "extension",
          "how": [
            "Unzip it",
            "Open chrome://extensions",
            "Turn on Developer mode",
            "Load unpacked"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "sign-in",
          "word": "Sign in to Gmail",
          "kind": "sign-in",
          "probe": "signedIn",
          "how": [
            "Open Gmail",
            "Sign in as usual"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "pin-tab",
          "word": "Keep Gmail open",
          "kind": "pin-tab",
          "probe": "pinned",
          "how": [
            "The Prism pins Gmail"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "out": "approve"
    },
